gadX(){return'Worked out from each route\'s published timetable plus the estimated travel time from the first stop \u2014 not live vehicle positions, so traffic can shift it by a few minutes.\n\nMost routes only publish "every N minutes" (no per-trip times); the app shows exactly that instead of inventing times.\n\nLast trip is when the last bus is expected at this stop.'},
